1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,333
This is the SRIT India I P O, a mainboard offer,

2
00:00:03,333 --> 00:00:07,360
open from the twenty-eighth to the thirtieth of September.

3
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:10,800
The price band is ₹123 to ₹130.

4
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:16,586
Every figure here comes from the final red herring prospectus

5
00:00:16,586 --> 00:00:18,578
and exchange notices;

6
00:00:18,578 --> 00:00:22,277
the final price is fixed after bidding,

7
00:00:22,277 --> 00:00:26,356
so valuations are computed at the ₹130 cap.

8
00:00:26,856 --> 00:00:28,093
First, the business.

9
00:00:28,593 --> 00:00:34,007
SRIT India builds and runs digital platforms for governments and enterprises,

10
00:00:34,007 --> 00:00:37,873
in healthcare, e-governance, and telecom and broadband.

11
00:00:38,373 --> 00:00:42,790
It combines its own software products with system integration

12
00:00:42,790 --> 00:00:44,311
and managed services,

13
00:00:44,311 --> 00:00:48,293
and has added AI video analytics and conversational AI.

14
00:00:48,793 --> 00:00:51,055
It has a twenty-six-year track record.

15
00:00:51,555 --> 00:00:53,155
The financial checkpoint.

16
00:00:53,655 --> 00:01:04,008
FY26 revenue was ₹450.00 Cr, against ₹389.35 Cr in FY25,

17
00:01:04,008 --> 00:01:07,521
a change of 15.58%.

18
00:01:08,021 --> 00:01:15,275
Profit after tax was ₹43.29 Cr, a margin of 9.62%.

19
00:01:15,775 --> 00:01:20,086
Profit grew faster than revenue:

20
00:01:20,086 --> 00:01:23,049
28.82% against 15.58%.

21
00:01:23,549 --> 00:01:30,440
Debt to equity fell to 0.23, and return on equity was 29.98%.

22
00:01:30,940 --> 00:01:35,907
The offer size at the cap is ₹218.40 Cr,

23
00:01:35,907 --> 00:01:39,260
and it is 100% fresh issue.

24
00:01:39,760 --> 00:01:42,145
All of that money goes into the company;

25
00:01:42,145 --> 00:01:45,008
no existing shareholder is selling in this deal.

26
00:01:45,508 --> 00:01:46,831
Where does the money go?

27
00:01:47,331 --> 00:01:53,307
It is a 100% fresh issue of 1,68,00,000 shares,

28
00:01:53,307 --> 00:01:56,867
about ₹218.40 Cr at the cap.

29
00:01:57,367 --> 00:02:01,164
₹124.00 Cr funds working capital,

30
00:02:01,164 --> 00:02:05,537
and ₹12.86 Cr modernises its products.

31
00:02:06,037 --> 00:02:10,415
The rest can go to acquisitions and general corporate purposes.

32
00:02:10,415 --> 00:02:15,488
The working-capital need shows how much cash government contracts tie up.

33
00:02:15,988 --> 00:02:16,991
Valuation.

34
00:02:17,491 --> 00:02:20,007
At the ₹130 cap,

35
00:02:20,007 --> 00:02:28,029
the price is 13.73x FY26 earnings of ₹9.47 a share.

36
00:02:28,529 --> 00:02:37,511
Peers range from Mastek at 12.59x and Allied Digital at 15.52x

37
00:02:37,511 --> 00:02:43,740
to Protean at 19.80x and RailTel at 24.03x.

38
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:46,544
So it is at the lower end of the range.

39
00:02:47,044 --> 00:02:48,537
Now balance the evidence.

40
00:02:49,037 --> 00:02:50,301
Watch-out:

41
00:02:50,301 --> 00:02:55,732
Working-capital heavy government contracts.

42
00:02:55,732 --> 00:02:56,869
Strength:

43
00:02:56,869 --> 00:03:00,280
PAT up 28.82% to ₹43.29 Cr.

44
00:03:00,780 --> 00:03:02,008
Watch-out:

45
00:03:02,008 --> 00:03:07,534
₹124.00 Cr of proceeds go to working capital.

46
00:03:07,534 --> 00:03:08,639
Strength:

47
00:03:08,639 --> 00:03:09,744
Low debt:

48
00:03:09,744 --> 00:03:10,849
D/E 0.23.

49
00:03:11,349 --> 00:03:12,426
Watch-out:

50
00:03:12,426 --> 00:03:16,409
Acquisition funds not yet identified.

51
00:03:16,409 --> 00:03:17,378
Strength:

52
00:03:17,378 --> 00:03:20,715
13.73x P/E, lower end of peers.

53
00:03:21,215 --> 00:03:22,345
How to apply.

54
00:03:22,845 --> 00:03:27,574
The minimum bid is one lot of 115 shares,

55
00:03:27,574 --> 00:03:30,803
which is ₹14,950 at the cap.

56
00:03:31,303 --> 00:03:34,778
Retail investors can bid up to two lakh rupees,

57
00:03:34,778 --> 00:03:38,919
and allotment is by lottery if retail is oversubscribed.

58
00:03:39,419 --> 00:03:43,962
Check live subscription on the N S E or B S E website,

59
00:03:43,962 --> 00:03:45,392
not social media.

60
00:03:45,892 --> 00:03:46,852
Let's recap.

61
00:03:47,352 --> 00:03:53,394
FY26 revenue ₹450.00 Cr, profit ₹43.29 Cr.

62
00:03:53,394 --> 00:03:56,846
The offer is 100% fresh.

63
00:03:56,846 --> 00:04:02,600
Valuation is 13.73x earnings at the cap.

64
00:04:02,600 --> 00:04:07,491
The minimum investment is ₹14,950.

65
00:04:07,991 --> 00:04:12,164
This video is public-source education from the red herring

66
00:04:12,164 --> 00:04:14,467
prospectus and exchange notices.

67
00:04:14,467 --> 00:04:18,425
It is not investment advice and not a buy or sell call.

68
00:04:18,425 --> 00:04:20,224
Read the final documents,

69
00:04:20,224 --> 00:04:23,102
check live subscription on the exchange,

70
00:04:23,102 --> 00:04:25,837
and consult a SEBI-registered adviser.

71
00:04:25,837 --> 00:04:27,276
Thanks for watching.

